Acknowledgements
----------------

This project runs on top of the OpenClaw agent runtime (a third-party Node.js
gateway). OpenClaw is required at runtime but is not redistributed in this
repository — install it from the upstream package.

The agent workspace shipped here references the following community skills.
Each is fetched separately from its upstream homepage and is **not** included
in this repository:

- proactive-agent (Hal Labs)
  https://github.com/hal-labs/proactive-agent

- self-improving-agent (Hal Labs)
  https://github.com/hal-labs/self-improving-agent

- claw-shell, clawdhub, qmd, summarize
  Bundled with the OpenClaw CLI; installable via `openclaw skills install <name>`.

After cloning this repo, install the skills you want with:

    openclaw skills install proactive-agent
    openclaw skills install self-improving-agent

